{"title":"Career roadmap — Copywriter","role":"Copywriter","summary":"A Copywriter creates persuasive, strategic and audience-focused written content for advertising, branding, marketing, digital campaigns, social media, websites, email, video, products and other communication channels. The strongest copywriters combine writing + consumer psychology + brand strategy + creativity + digital marketing + AI-assisted workflows.","facts":{"Current degree":"BA (Bachelor of Arts – General / Honours)","Course":"Advertising / Public Relations / Event Management (BA)"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Build copywriting, advertising, consumer psychology, brand and digital-marketing fundamentals"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Work in advertising agencies, creative agencies, startups, media companies or in-house brand teams"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Progress into Senior Copywriter, Creative Lead, Brand Strategist or Creative Director roles"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Lead creative teams, build campaigns, develop brand narratives or operate an independent creative consultancy"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to build each year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Writing + advertising foundation"},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"English grammar and vocabulary"},{"text":"Creative writing"},{"text":"Advertising fundamentals"},{"text":"Consumer behaviour"},{"text":"Psychology"},{"text":"Brand communication"},{"text":"Marketing fundamentals"},{"text":"Media studies"},{"text":"Storytelling"},{"text":"Communication theory"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Practise:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Headlines"},{"text":"Taglines"},{"text":"Product descriptions"},{"text":"Social-media captions"},{"text":"Short advertisements"},{"text":"Brand stories"},{"text":"Calls to action"}]},{"t